WEBVTT

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.020
<i>Your secret weapon?</i>

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.230
<i>It's just a stupid pendulum move.</i>

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:12.700
<i>I'm going to end your life with this powerful right!</i>

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.670
<i>I-Impossible!</i>

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.180
<i>He stopped?!</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.170
<i>C-Crap! I can't stop!</i>

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.070
Whoa! He knocked him down!

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:08.550
Just when we thought the challenger was going to pull off another powerful counter,

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.240
the champion comes back with a bruising hit!

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:15.310
That son of a bitch!

00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:16.810
He did it!

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.560
<i>He crushed the Dempsey Crusher.</i>

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.310
Ryuuhei!

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:23.810
He did it.

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:25.900
Get to a neutral corner!

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:29.900
Even battered and bruised, he still packs that destructive power!

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:33.770
The sound of a blunt object shattering a boulder filled this very Hall!

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:40.080
<i>He stopped the Dempsey Roll right in the middle?</i>

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:44.490
<i>Its only weakness was its too regular rhythm,</i>

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:46.460
<i>but he overcame it magnificently.</i>

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:50.470
<i>This truly is the new Dempsey Roll.</i>

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:52.200
That gave me chills.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:55.760
And I've experienced his Dempsey Roll's destructive power firsthand.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.480
Though he stopped it midway and had enough strength to land that blow.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.430
That's gonna leave a mark for sure.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:06.210
<i>That gave me goose bumps, too.</i>

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:10.610
<i>I thought I was going to use Sawamura's Dempsey Crusher.</i>

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:14.280
<i>But he was able to change the timing?</i>

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.120
<i>That would render a counter useless.</i>

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.660
<i>That could have been me lying on the mat.</i>

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.710
<i>You really did it.</i>

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.410
<i>That's right.</i>

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.460
<i>What I really wanted to see...</i>

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.140
<i>is what I'm looking at now!</i>

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:39.140
<i>That kid was in a real predicament. 
He probably even foresaw his own loss.</i>

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:43.440
<i>That's why he put all of his training on the canvas tonight.</i>

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.860
<i>He was trying to attempt the new 
Dempsey Roll right from the start.</i>

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:53.080
<i>Even when he wasn't successful, he made those attempts.</i>

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:57.700
<i>That's why he withstood the force of those two counters.</i>

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.930
<i>And now, he sees the fruits of his labor.{changed "you" to "he" as in the previous line}</i>

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.730
I... I can still fight.

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.100
Dumbass.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:18.760
Whoa, he stood up!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.240
The Owari Dragon is not dead!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:31.070
<i>If you do more than that,
 your career will be cut short.</i>

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:33.430
<i>I'll do it dozens of times if I have to.</i>

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:35.070
<i>I've made my decision!</i>

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.070
The match restarts!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:40.530
Makunouchi! Makunouchi!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.250
The fans are suddenly chanting Makunouchi's name!

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:46.790
The champion responds by gamely drawing upon his last strength!

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:49.320
The challenger can't hide the hurting he's taken!

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:50.590
<i>Ryuuhei...</i>

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:53.340
The challenger topples over!

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.840
Will he go down? Will he?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:02.180
What's this? He's actually ducking behind the referee!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.170
What kind of cheater are you?

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:07.230
Quit delaying the inevitable! Fight him like a man!

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.410
Sawamura! Let go!

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:13.180
<i>I don't know my left from my right.</i>

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.940
<i>All I know is...</i>

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.000
<i>I don't wanna lose.</i>

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.450
<i>I don't wanna! I don't wanna!</i>

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:20.410
Now!

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:21.880
Stop!

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:23.910
And that's the bell!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.760
That's the end of the sixth round!

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.040
He just couldn't take him out in time!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.520
The outcome will have to wait for the seventh round!

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:32.610
You all right?

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.870
<i>You must be shocked, Sawamura.</i>

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:40.490
<i>It was you who said that the Dempsey Roll was a pathetic move.</i>

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:43.100
<i>But now he's developed a new one.</i>

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:47.200
<i>That punch didn't come from a moment of inspiration.</i>

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.940
<i>That was born out of grueling training.</i>

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:53.540
<i>Makunouchi is not a born fighter in the least.</i>

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.900
<i>He's not one of your kind.</i>

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.610
<i>But...</i>

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.950
<i>that's what makes his kind the toughest.</i>

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.310
<i>He's a purebred boxer,</i>

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:07.660
<i>who trains for hours on end to display his power in the ring and nowhere else.</i>

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.830
A-Aren't you going to sit down, Ippo-kun?

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:15.730
<i>He's unable to sit down!</i>

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:21.930
<i>That powerful stop-and-go twisting motion of the new Dempsey Roll has given him muscle spasms.</i>

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:25.050
<i>Adding that to the damage he took from Sawamura...</i>

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:29.220
<i>would mean he's in so much pain,
 he couldn't stand up again if he sat.</i>

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:31.940
You want water?

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.440
Sure, drink up.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:40.700
<i>Your determination and do-or-die attitude is as clear as day.</i>

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:42.440
<i>All I can do...</i>

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.950
<i>is see you through the end!</i>

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:50.990
<i>It's flowing through me.</i>

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.730
<i>I feel somewhat revived.</i>

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:57.550
<i>Huh? What's that?</i>

00:05:57.550 --> 00:06:02.590
Makunouchi! Makunouchi! Makunouchi!

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.130
<i>They're cheering.</i>

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.680
<i>Yes. I'll do what I can.</i>

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.860
<i>Thank you very much! I'll stick it out!</i>

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:22.450
<i>Thank you very much!</i>

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:24.340
<i>I'll see it through!</i>

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:25.910
<i>I'll do it!</i>

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.850
<i>Thanks to you all, I'm getting renewed strength.</i>

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.710
<i>I'll keep going!</i>

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.370
Can't they do something about that cheering?!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.750
It's too overwhelming!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:37.670
Still...

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:40.980
I guess you can't even hear them anymore.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:42.810
I can't let you...

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:43.630
I...

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:48.180
I'm not... gonna lose.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:51.470
<i>There's no one in my corner.</i>

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:54.060
<i>I can only trust myself.</i>

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:57.520
<i>I used to wait and hope,</i>

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:01.780
<i>only to receive the long knife in the back.</i>

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.030
<i>I only believe in my own self.</i>

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:06.830
<i>My own fists.</i>

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.280
Sawamura!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:13.920
<i>I will not lose the one thing I believe in.</i>

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.420
<i>I will not lose, period.</i>

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:18.260
Box!

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:20.100
The seventh round begins!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:23.860
Will the champion win the fight with the new and improved Dempsey Roll?

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:27.190
Or will the challenger's tenacity eventually lead to his victory?

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:33.730
<i>What's pushing Sawamura to win is not weak-ass bullshit like "tenacity."</i>

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:36.280
<i>It's malice.</i>

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.340
<i>Malice will push a guy to do anything.</i>

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.650
<i>If you lose focus for even a second,</i>

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:45.650
<i>he'll unleash hell, Makunouchi.</i>

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.910
I'm not going to lose.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:53.660
<i>He's got the towel ready even with the tables turned?</i>

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:57.670
<i>Has Ippo-kun truly reached his limit?</i>

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:02.100
<i>I got here thanks to everyone's support!</i>

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.670
<i>I have to do this!</i>

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.420
<i>I have to win!</i>

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.570
<i>I don't care... what happens to me!</i>

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.570
{commercial}

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:15.100
Makunouchi! Makunouchi! Makunouchi!

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:18.390
The challenger strikes first! With his Bullets!

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:21.650
But he's blocked!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.740
Two! Three!

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.450
The challenger's not moving!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.680
<i>That's good punching!</i>

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:41.530
<i>You got this round, kid.</i>

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.500
<i>Do whatever the hell you want!</i>

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.060
<i>Then we'll see if I throw in the towel.</i>

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:50.220
<i>I pray I'll use it to wipe your sweat after you win.</i>

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:53.550
He drives the challenger to the ropes!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.220
But the champion isn't done yet!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.140
He continues to attack with his limitless stamina!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.190
Get him!

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.430
Good job, Makunouchi!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.230
Kick his ass!

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.830
The challenger's face writhes in pain!

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.110
Now that was a heavy right!

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.360
I can't believe he's still standing!

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:10.280
A left!

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.420
That got him!

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:16.290
Nope! He's still up!

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.870
Ryuuhei!

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:20.900
<i>I don't wanna... lose...</i>

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:24.790
<i>I know I have the power.</i>

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:28.170
<i>People begged for mercy before this fist.</i>

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:32.260
<i>If I lose faith in this...</i>

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:35.220
<i>it's back to square one.</i>

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:40.040
<i>Back to when I waited for something that never came.</i>

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.020
<i>I'm not going to lose!</i>

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:48.680
<i>I will not lose everything!</i>

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:50.360
<i>I will win!</i>

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:55.370
<i>He puts out his foot again!</i>

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:58.660
<i>He still has that up his sleeve!</i>

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:05.040
<i>That's timed to ruin whatever rhythm Makunouchi has.</i>

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.760
<i>H-He dodged it!</i>

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.260
<i>Such...</i>

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.760
<i>concentration.</i>

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:24.650
<i>Yes! Fall!</i>

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:32.320
Whoa! The challenger still has some strength left!

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:33.700
He returns fire!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.200
<i>He timed that counter perfectly without even thinking!</i>

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.870
Unbelievable.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:44.460
After taking Makunouchi's punches, not only is he still standing, he's fighting back!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:48.960
<i>That's not bodily strength we're seeing. His willpower is the only thing keeping him going.</i>

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:51.970
<i>He's strong. He really is strong!</i>

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.340
<i>I knew it right from the start.</i>

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:59.970
<i>The only way to win against him... to vanquish Sawamura-san...</i>

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:09.400
<i>is this!</i>

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:13.240
Th-There it is! The Dempsey Roll!

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.610
The new one?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:15.950
Ryuuhei.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.630
<i>Now!</i>

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:35.880
<i>Oh, I know.</i>

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:38.180
<i>You're stopping, aren't you?</i>

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.600
<i>You can't fool me... twice!</i>

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:45.570
<i>He stopped!</i>

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:47.940
<i>He crushed the Crusher of the Dempsey Crusher!{changed placement of "Crusher"}</i>

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:50.770
<i>So he's figured it out?</i>

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.030
<i>His natural talents. They're to be feared!</i>

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:58.870
<i>I'll just slow down the timing...</i>

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:00.640
<i>and match up that punch!</i>

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.290
<i>Right here! Die!</i>

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:09.790
<i>There?!</i>

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:14.050
<i>I will counter whatever you throw at me!</i>

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.140
<i>He stopped right there?</i>

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:28.500
<i>I don't know what the hell is going on!</i>

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.450
He's on the canvas! He's down!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:29.210
The Dempsey Roll comes roaring back!

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.460
Can the challenger stand up!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:36.190
Wait, is he even breathing?

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:51.350
The champion is raising his fists like he knows he won!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.150
And that's the end of the match!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.550
Kid! Kid!

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.160
C-Coach!

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.960
I did it.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:06.300
I won, Coach.

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.200
No talking!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.580
Don't move him!

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:13.330
Someone get a stretcher!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:17.550
A squall of applause rains upon the ring that has just been through a death match!

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.580
That was amazing!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.360
Makunouchi's punches are just too powerful!

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.380
Can't believe he withstood those for that long!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.320
You were incredible, Sawamura!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.200
Yeah, he was strong!

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.100
<i>He sure was...</i>

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:38.270
<i>He was... really tough.</i>

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.860
You did great, Sawamura!

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:41.740
Come to the Hall anytime!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:42.910
We'll have your back!

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:45.530
Please no more fouls!

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:48.190
<i>I can't believe this applause.</i>

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:52.610
<i>These people started off jeering him, but now they're cheering for him.</i>

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.480
<i>Do you hear that, Ryuuhei?</i>

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.060
<i>Everyone is praising you.</i>

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:01.170
<i>Everyone's recognizing your talents.</i>

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.410
<i>Do you hear that?</i>

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:07.180
<i>Are you still alone?</i>

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:10.430
I hope Sawamura's not dead.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.810
I'll go with him.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.440
It ain't like we're strangers or anything.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:19.890
<i>You got me all fired up, Makunouchi!</i>

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:22.900
Who's he trying to fool?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:29.500
Well, this match will fire up any active boxer who sees it. Right?

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:32.370
You're talking to the wrong boxer.

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.590
Excuse me, Date-san.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:40.860
<i>That new Dempsey Roll is not just some stop-and-go move.</i>

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.050
<i>It's a brutal anti-counter that comes with left and right feints.</i>

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:48.490
<i>There's no one who can stop it.{nobody  - no one}</i>

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:50.350
<i>No one but...</i>

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.810
<i>It's intriguing.</i>

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:56.060
<i>That'll even fire up non-active boxers.</i>

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.360
<i>They're, in a word, strong.{feels weird with "They're"; maybe "he's"?}</i>

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:02.320
Thank you very much! Thank you very much!

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:04.910
All right, this is where we go greet him!

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:05.570
Okay!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.020
Ippo!

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:26.350
Severed muscle fibers, ruptured capillaries, and stretched ligaments.

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:32.600
But, luckily, he managed to avoid any career-threatening injuries.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:36.890
Your reinforced muscle mass barely saved you this time around.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:38.850
I-Is that true?

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.450
Don't move!

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.610
You're still in critical condition!

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:44.220
Thank God!

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:45.630
What a relief.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:49.610
You remember what happened when you put down Sawamura for good?

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:54.120
You had him on bended knees! That bastard deserved it!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.440
You also pumped your fists.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.910
You must've got the payback you wanted.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.880
That wasn't the reason.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:10.550
I was boxing a very strong opponent. All the fouls and run-ins out of the ring didn't matter.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:17.140
All I wanted to do was to defeat that very tough opponent any way I could. That's all.

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:20.930
When I finally KO'd him, it didn't really sink in who I just beat.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:24.900
All I thought was, "I did it!" Then I...

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:26.860
Pumped your fists, eh?

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:28.240
That's just like you.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:32.530
<i>I was really desperate back then. That's why I'm so happy.</i>

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.050
<i>I'm so pumped, it's almost making my pain go away!</i>

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:43.630
Three fractured ribs and four broken teeth.

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:47.660
But what's really cause for concern is the fracture at the fundus of his left eye.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:49.630
That eyeball has sunken out of place.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.850
He needs immediate surgery.

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:59.140
Makunouchi's destructive prowess once again gives me chills.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:03.560
Sawamura did great just withstanding those punches.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.060
Yes, indeed.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.870
He did very well.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.280
Also...

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:15.880
Ryuuhei may have lost this fight, but it might also mark a new beginning for him.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.330
Who'd think the great Owari Dragon would fall this hard?

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.040
Strange, ain't it?

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:29.210
Even after going through this much pain, you don't think about quitting boxing.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.840
That's what Makunouchi's fists will do to you.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:39.160
Unlike us, he didn't hone his fists through brawling.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.850
He did it through straight training.

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:46.470
"If you train, you win. And you get even stronger."

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:50.070
That's what you learn each time he hits you.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:55.870
"I wish to train more and get better so that I can beat you."

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:59.080
That's what you think after fighting him.

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:03.310
Our fists try to make sure people never get up again.

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:05.080
Our fists strike you dead.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:10.750
On the other hand, Makunouchi's fists make people fired up.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:14.220
His fists give you life.

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:17.970
{}Huh, I see you're asleep.

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:26.060
Don't blame you after surviving that death match.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.530
That must have been really hard.{changed "brutal" to "really hard"}

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.250
Well...

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:48.350
I'm used to it, trust me.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:51.210
Now I know that I can't win alone.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.260
I won the match with everyone's strength.

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:58.600
And I'm so glad I won.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:02.200
I'm never going to stop.

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:04.230
I'll keep boxing!
